<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE - DAEWOO ELECTRONICS H1 NET FALLS.</title>
<headline>TABLE - DAEWOO ELECTRONICS H1 NET FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		  (in billions of won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net					    23.5 vs 25.3</p>
<p>    Ordinary profit			    27.4 vs 31.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				  1,789.4 vs 1,640.2</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			  29.3 vs 31.0</p>
<p>Note - Daewoo Electronics Co Ltd, a unit of the Daewoo Group, said the number of its shares increased by 1.34 million to 79.65 million at the end of June from a year ago through bond conversion.</p>
</text>
